# environments/local-okd/app-secrets.sops.env is SOPS ciphertext whose own
# metadata (sops_lastmodified, sops_mac, ...) is strictly parsed on
# decrypt - a stray \r from Windows CRLF conversion breaks that parse
# (getsops/sops#1157). This machine's global core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise silently corrupt it on checkout/commit. Pin LF
# unconditionally so that can never happen. `eol=lf` (not `-text`) keeps
# it diffable line-by-line - each key's ENC[...] blob is its own line,
# which is the whole point of --input-type dotenv mode (clean per-key
# diffs instead of a full-file rewrite on every secret rotation).
environments/local-okd/app-secrets.sops.env text eol=lf
